rong>CHOOSE WISELY:</strong> Your answers during branching conversations will not only determine other characters' opinion about you, but also the fate of your kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udddd\ufe0f <strong>USE YOUR WITS:</strong> Investigate, gather evidence, solve puzzles, and expose the conspirators at the royal court!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e\u00a0<strong>A MAGICAL TALE:</strong> Elflock is a fairy tale based on Hungarian folklore and it is told mainly in Hungarian, one of the world\u2019s most unique languages \u2013 with English subtitles of course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc78 <strong>AN EYE-CATCHING EXPERIENCE:</strong> Immerse yourself in a multitude of authentic medieval locations with realistic graphics! Choose from different dresses or accessories, and find your own style with the character customization feature.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WISHLIST NOW!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094690/extras/04f6718b4c8573fdf3af95e0e356aa33.poster.avif?t=1767669000\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094690/extras/04f6718b4c8573fdf3af95e0e356aa33.webm?t=1767669000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094690/extras/04f6718b4c8573fdf3af95e0e356aa33.mp4?t=1767669000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["NovaSphera Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094690/825c3ff5a3db2290fec4f9ac9be1bb2e73ddf07d/header.jpg?t=1767669000","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Elflock \u00a9 2024 Balazs Domsodi. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>